# 📊 CRUD + HTTP Methods

The four basic database operations are called **CRUD**.

| CRUD Operation | HTTP Method | Example |
|---|---|---|
| **Create** | `POST` | `/products/` |
| **Read** | `GET` | `/products/` |
| **Update** | `PUT / PATCH` | `/products/10/` |
| **Delete** | `DELETE` | `/products/10/` |

### 🔥 Easy Memory Trick

```text
C → POST
R → GET
U → PUT / PATCH
D → DELETE
```

