# 🎯 Key Takeaways

> 🔹 **API** allows applications to communicate.

> 🔹 **Client** sends the request.

> 🔹 **Server** processes the request and returns a response.

> 🔹 **REST** is an architectural style for designing APIs.

> 🔹 **HTTP methods** define the operation being performed.

